With blinding speed, you suddenly appear next to a target up to 6 spaces away and attack for [37%, 43%, 48%, 53%, 57% (TL1-5)] (at 0 Hate) to [123%, 145%, 162%, 177%, 190% (TL1-5)] (at 100+ Hate) damage. Your sudden appearance catches everyone off-guard, giving you [19, 24, 29, 32, 35 (TL1-5; STR 100)] extra Defense for 1 turn.

The Defense boost improves with your Strength.
